两秒，然后无奈又好笑地说：“哼！“，侧过头，爬上了床，一边爬一边说：\n“我就知道你小子没安好心..”，然后在床上一边保持着跪爬的姿势，一边回过头来，对着镜头主角宠溺地说：\n“行了，过来吧~”一边右手缓慢脱下内衣带子。"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":4845,"type":"LTXVSeparateAVLatent","pos":[-798.652111699169,3072.7781591870753],"size":[193.2916015625,46],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":32,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"音视频潜空间","name":"av_latent","type":"LATENT","link":13113}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video_latent","name":"video_latent","type":"LATENT","links":[13110]},{"localized_name":"audio_latent","name":"audio_latent","type":"LATENT","links":[13105]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.10.0","Node name for S&R":"LTXVSeparateAVLatent","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":4982,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1087.4268362735945,2494.5761319577737],"size":[547.4164453831668,148.1180607062829],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["https://github.com/Lightricks/ComfyUI-LTXVideo/blob/master/example_workflows/2.3/LTX-2.3_T2V_I2V_Single_Stage_Distilled_Full.json\n\n\nDistrilled版本很快，效果稍微差一点  -- 文生5秒视频-50秒，10秒视频——80秒 20秒视频-180s 30秒视频-300 45秒-560秒 1分钟-880秒（需要开启--disable-smart-memory）\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFull慢"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":4851,"type":"VAEDecodeTiled","pos":[-434.4648002758107,2942.134842900515],"size":[270,150],"flags":{},"order":33,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":13110},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":13280},{"localized_name":"分块尺寸","name":"tile_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tile_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"重叠","name":"overlap","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"overlap"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"时间尺寸","name":"temporal_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"temporal_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"时间重叠","n